{"5158320":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Deer Hunting - The Season 2","steam_appid":5158320,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is an open world hunting simulation.  Step into the world of a North American Big Game Hunter with access to thousands of acres of private hunting land to manage and hunt.  Main species at release are Whitetail Deer, Mule Deer, to follow are Eastern Turkey, Merriam Turkey, Rio Grande Turkey, Elk, Black Bear, Moose, Big Horn Sheep, Coyote &amp; Wolves  You will be able to hunt multiple properties including at release Nebraska and Missouri, to follow are Iowa, Wisconsin, Colorado, Saskatchewan.  Manage and grow your deer herd between your properties to maximize your shot at a world class buck during each season!  Deer will grow from year to year and you will have the ability to assign names from trail camera photos.  Plant food plots based towards early or late season feeding needs.  Each season you will start in spring Turkey Season and then progress through Summer into Fall and end in the cold harsh Winter weather were food is the ultimate draw for Deer.  Hunt with multiple firearms including compound bows, Rifle, Shotgun &amp; Muzzleloader.  <\/p>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is an open world hunting simulation.  Step into the world of a North American Big Game Hunter with access to thousands of acres of private hunting land to manage and hunt.  Main species at release are Whitetail Deer, Mule Deer, to follow are Eastern Turkey, Merriam Turkey, Rio Grande Turkey, Elk, Black Bear, Moose, Big Horn Sheep, Coyote &amp; Wolves  You will be able to hunt multiple properties including at release Nebraska and Missouri, to follow are Iowa, Wisconsin, Colorado, Saskatchewan.  Manage and grow your deer herd between your properties to maximize your shot at a world class buck during each season!  Deer will grow from year to year and you will have the ability to assign names from trail camera photos.  Plant food plots based towards early or late season feeding needs.  Each season you will start in spring Turkey Season and then progress through Summer into Fall and end in the cold harsh Winter weather were food is the ultimate draw for Deer.  Hunt with multiple firearms including compound bows, Rifle, Shotgun &amp; Muzzleloader.  <\/p>","short_description":"This is a open world hunting simulation. Hunt some of North Americas best hunting spots for trophy Whitetail Deer, Mule Deer, and more to come soon! Manage and grow your bucks from one year to the next. Hunt with multiple firearms including compound bows, Rifle, Shotgun &amp; Muzzleloader.  ","supported_languages":"English","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5158320\/e3bc6cb5bec47a8a980e34217b1168373ea07862\/header.jpg?t=1790974826","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5158320\/6d244ec5bd221cb21be834404c02881d412ecd93\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1790974826","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5158320\/6d244ec5bd221cb21be834404c02881d412ecd93\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1790974826","website":"https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/ChaosEntertainmentGames","pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br><\/li><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Intel Core i5-3470, 3.20 GHz | AMD FX-6300, 3.5 GHz<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 16 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 30 GB available space<\/li><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br><\/li><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Intel Core i9<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 32 GB RAM<br><\/li><l